<mvc:View controllerName="pharma.scm.controller.App" displayBlock="true" height="100%" xmlns="sap.m" xmlns:mvc="sap.ui.core.mvc" xmlns:tnt="sap.tnt" xmlns:core="sap.ui.core">
<tnt:ToolPage id="toolPage">
<tnt:header><tnt:ToolHeader>
<Button class="menuBtn" icon="sap-icon://menu2" type="Transparent" press=".onToggle" tooltip="Menu"><layoutData><OverflowToolbarLayoutData priority="NeverOverflow"/></layoutData></Button>
<core:Icon src="sap-icon://pharmacy" color="#2563eb" size="1.5rem" class="sapUiTinyMarginEnd"><core:layoutData><OverflowToolbarLayoutData priority="NeverOverflow"/></core:layoutData></core:Icon>
<Title text="PharmaSCM" wrapping="false"><layoutData><OverflowToolbarLayoutData priority="NeverOverflow"/></layoutData></Title>
<Text text="Inventory &amp; Supply Chain" class="hdrSub"/>
<ToolbarSpacer/>
<Button icon="sap-icon://bell" type="Transparent" tooltip="Alerts" press=".onAlerts"><customData><BadgeCustomData key="badge" value="{= ${app>/alerts}.length || '' }"/></customData><layoutData><OverflowToolbarLayoutData priority="NeverOverflow"/></layoutData></Button>
<Avatar initials="PA" displaySize="XS" backgroundColor="Accent6" tooltip="Pharma Admin"><layoutData><OverflowToolbarLayoutData priority="NeverOverflow"/></layoutData></Avatar>
</tnt:ToolHeader></tnt:header>
<tnt:sideContent><tnt:SideNavigation id="sideNav" itemSelect=".onSelect"><tnt:NavigationList>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="01  Dashboard &amp; Analytics" icon="sap-icon://home" key="dashboard"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="02  Medicine Master" icon="sap-icon://pharmacy" key="medicines"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="03  Batch &amp; Expiry" icon="sap-icon://product" key="batches"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="04  Purchase Management" icon="sap-icon://cart" key="purchase"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="05  Inventory Management" icon="sap-icon://inventory" key="inventory"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="06  Warehouse Management" icon="sap-icon://building" key="warehouse"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="07  Vendor &amp; Customer" icon="sap-icon://group" key="partners"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="08  Sales &amp; Distribution" icon="sap-icon://shipping-status" key="sales"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="09  Quality Management" icon="sap-icon://quality-issue" key="quality"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="10  Reports &amp; Alerts" icon="sap-icon://bar-chart" key="reports"/>
</tnt:NavigationList></tnt:SideNavigation></tnt:sideContent>
<tnt:mainContents><NavContainer id="pageContainer"/></tnt:mainContents>
</tnt:ToolPage>

<VBox id="scrim" class="phoneScrim"/>
<VBox id="drawer" class="phoneDrawer">
<HBox alignItems="Center" class="drawerHead"><core:Icon src="sap-icon://pharmacy" color="#2563eb" size="1.5rem" class="sapUiTinyMarginEnd"/><Title text="PharmaSCM"/></HBox>
<tnt:NavigationList id="drawerNav" itemSelect=".onSelect">
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="01  Dashboard &amp; Analytics" icon="sap-icon://home" key="dashboard"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="02  Medicine Master" icon="sap-icon://pharmacy" key="medicines"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="03  Batch &amp; Expiry" icon="sap-icon://product" key="batches"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="04  Purchase Management" icon="sap-icon://cart" key="purchase"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="05  Inventory Management" icon="sap-icon://inventory" key="inventory"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="06  Warehouse Management" icon="sap-icon://building" key="warehouse"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="07  Vendor &amp; Customer" icon="sap-icon://group" key="partners"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="08  Sales &amp; Distribution" icon="sap-icon://shipping-status" key="sales"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="09  Quality Management" icon="sap-icon://quality-issue" key="quality"/>
<tnt:NavigationListItem text="10  Reports &amp; Alerts" icon="sap-icon://bar-chart" key="reports"/>
</tnt:NavigationList>
</VBox>
</mvc:View>